zink: present through the sw winsys under xlib GLX.

Upstream zink only presents through kopper (VK_KHR_xcb/wayland surfaces);
Vortek only has VK_KHR_xlib_surface. Like Mesa <= 22 (and Winlator's
zink-22.2.5), give display-target resources a winsys display target and on
flush_frontbuffer read the image back into it and let the xlib winsys
XShmPutImage it. glXSwapBuffers passes no context, so the xlib frontend falls
back to its per-display context for the readback.

